(10, 'Pentingnya Konsep Growth Mindset dalam Meningkatkan Kepercayaan Diri Siswa', 'pentingnya-konsep-growth-mindset-dalam-meningkatkan-kepercayaan-diri-siswa', 'published', 'Muhammad Dzulhadi', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII A - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Pentingnya Konsep <em>Growth Mindset</em> Dalam Meningkatkan </strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Kepercayaan Diri Siswa</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Muhammad Dzulhadi, Hadi Khaerudin, Iwan Gunawan</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1 ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">E-mail = </span><a href=\"mailto:mdzulhadi11@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: blue;\">mdzulhadi11@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">This literature review aims to synthesize and analyze the views of experts, particularly Carol Dweck, regarding the urgency of applying the Growth Mindset concept as an effective strategy to enhance students\' academic self-confidence. The method used is a Simple Systematic Literature Review (SLR). Literature searches were conducted in academic databases using the key terms: \"Growth Mindset\", \"Fixed Mindset\", and \"Student Self-Confidence\". Relevant articles and books were selected, their contents were analyzed, and then synthesized to build a conceptual framework linking mindset with students\' psychological development. The synthesis results indicate that shifting from a Fixed Mindset (the belief that ability is static) to a Growth Mindset (the belief that ability can be developed) significantly influences the attribution of failure and learning perseverance. Students with a Growth Mindset tend to view challenges as opportunities, which in turn fosters a courageous attitude towards trying and reduces the fear of judgment. This is a key foundation for sustainable self-confidence enhancement. The Growth Mindset concept is proven not only as a motivational theory but also as a fundamental educational intervention tool for building a solid psychological foundation for students\' self-confidence in facing academic challenges.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords:</strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Fixed Mindset, Growth Mindset, Studi Literature</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Penelitian studi literatur ini bertujuan untuk mensintesis dan menganalisis pandangan para ahli, khususnya Carol Dweck, mengenai urgensi penerapan konsep </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Growth Mindset</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\"> (Pola Pikir Bertumbuh) sebagai strategi efektif untuk meningkatkan kepercayaan diri akademik pada siswa. Metode yang digunakan adalah </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Systematic Literature Review (SLR)</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">sederhana. Penelusuran literatur dilakukan pada basis data akademik dengan kata kunci utama: \"</span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Growth Mindset\", \"Fixed Mindset\"</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">, dan \"Kepercayaan Diri Siswa\". Artikel dan buku yang relevan dipilih, dianalisis kontennya, dan disintesis untuk membangun kerangka konseptual yang menghubungkan </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">mindset </em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">dengan perkembangan psikologis siswa. Hasil sintesis menunjukkan bahwa peralihan dari </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Fixed Mindset</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\"> (keyakinan bahwa kemampuan adalah tetap) menuju </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Growth Mindset</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\"> (keyakinan bahwa kemampuan dapat dikembangkan) secara signifikan memengaruhi atribusi kegagalan dan ketekunan belajar. Siswa dengan </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Growth Mindset</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\"> cenderung memandang tantangan sebagai peluang, yang pada gilirannya menumbuhkan sikap berani mencoba dan mengurangi rasa takut akan penilaian. Hal ini merupakan pondasi kunci bagi peningkatan kepercayaan diri yang berkelanjutan. Konsep </span><em style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\">Growth Mindset</em><span style=\"color: rgb(27, 28, 29);\"> terbukti bukan hanya sebagai teori motivasi, tetapi sebagai alat intervensi pendidikan yang fundamental untuk membangun landasan psikologis yang kokoh bagi kepercayaan diri siswa dalam menghadapi tantangan akademik.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci<em>: </em></strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Fixed Mindset, Growth Mindset, Studi Literatur</span></p><p><br></p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mz9RdrDtytOkxmoB_o5dr4y2fK1ELEiV/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></p><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/Asus/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\" width=\"4\" height=\"7\"><p><br></p><p>REFERENSI</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Bandura, Albert.&nbsp;<em>Bandura</em>. Vol. 2. Franco Angeli, 1997.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Blackwell, Lisa S., Kali H. Trzesniewski, and Carol Sorich Dweck, ‘Implicit Theories of Intelligence Predict Achievement across an Adolescent Transition: A Longitudinal Study and an Intervention’, <em>Child Development</em>, 78 (2007), 246–63 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-8624.2007.00995.x&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Carol Dweck, By, <em>Carol Dweck Revisits the ‘Growth Mindset’</em>, 2015</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Claro, Susana, David Paunesku, and Carol S. Dweck. \"Growth mindset tempers the effects of poverty on academic achievement.\"&nbsp;<em>Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences</em>&nbsp;113.31 (2016): 8664-8668.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Dweck, Carol S., and Ellen L. Leggett. \"A social-cognitive approach to motivation and personality.\"&nbsp;<em>Psychological review</em>&nbsp;95.2 (1988): 256.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Dweck, Carol S, <em>Mindset : The New Psychology of Success - </em><a href=\"http://pdfdrive.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: windowtext;\"><em>PDFDrive.Com</em></a></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Dweck, Carol. \"What having a “growth mindset” actually means.\"&nbsp;<em>Harvard business review</em>&nbsp;13.2 (2016): 2-5.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">https://muslim.or.id/95196-berperasangka-baik-kepada-allah.html</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Mujahid, K., and F. Muharromah. \"Pola Pikir Growth Mindset dalam Perspektif Nilai-nilai Islam.\"&nbsp;<em>TSAQOFAH Учредители: Darul Yasin Al Sys</em>&nbsp;5.1 (2025): 1054-1063.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Nasir, Mohamad, Politeknik Siber, and Cerdika Internasional, ‘Relationship between Growth Mindset and Academic Achievement Of’, 2022, 1–11</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Pajares, Frank, ‘Overview of Social Cognitive Theory’, <em>Emory University</em>, 2002, 1–5 &lt;http://www.emory.edu/EDUCATION/mfp/eff.html%0AHome&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Yeager, David Scott, and Carol S. Dweck, ‘Mindsets That Promote Resilience: When Students Believe That Personal Characteristics Can Be Developed’, <em>Educational Psychologist</em>, 47 (2012), 302–14 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1080/00461520.2012.722805&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Zed Mestika, ‘Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan’, <em>Jakarta: Yayasan Obor Indonesia</em>, 2003, 42–52.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Zimmerman, Barry J. \"Attaining self-regulation: A social cognitive perspective.\"&nbsp;<em>Handbook of self-regulation</em>. Academic press, 2000. 13-39.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;</span></p>', '', '2026-04-16 01:18:11', '2026-04-16 02:20:42', NULL, 0, NULL),
(11, 'Pencegahan Permasalahan Remaja Melalui Kegiatan Ekstrakurikuler Di Sekolah', 'pencegahan-permasalahan-remaja-melalui-kegiatan-ekstrakurikuler-di-sekolah', 'published', 'Ahmad Tsaqif', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII A - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Pencegahan Permasalahan Remaja Melalui Kegiatan Ekstrakurikuler Di Sekolah</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Ahmad Tsaqif, Hadi Khaerudin, Eniko Novi Wijayanti,</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><a href=\"mailto:tsakif.jabim@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: blue;\">tsakif.jabim@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Extracurricular activities in schools play a crucial role in reducing youth problems, particularly juvenile delinquency, through character development and channeling positive energy among students. This literature review examines how student participation in extracurricular activities can contribute to character building, reducing deviant behavior, and implementing Islamic values as a moral foundation. This article discusses three main focuses: (1) the relationship between extracurricular activities and character development, (2) extracurricular activities as a preventative measure for juvenile delinquency, and (3) the integration of Islamic values into extracurricular activities. The study\'s findings indicate that well-managed extracurricular activities, supported by the school environment, and integrated with Islamic values, can reduce the tendency for juvenile delinquency and strengthen a sense of responsibility, discipline, and positive identity. Schools are advised to design systematic extracurricular programs, involving both the school and parents, and incorporating Islamic character values to develop students with character and competitive</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Keywords ; The Influence of Extracurricular Activities to Reduce Juvenile Delinquency</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Kegiatan ekstrakurikuler di sekolah memegang peranan penting dalam upaya mengurangi permasalahan remaja, terutama kenakalan remaja, melalui pengembangan karakter dan penyaluran energi positif peserta didik. Kajian kepustakaan ini meninjau literatur tentang bagaimana partisipasi siswa dalam aktivitas ekstrakurikuler dapat berkontribusi terhadap penguatan karakter, pengurangan perilaku menyimpang, serta implementasi nilai-nilai Islam sebagai landasan moral. Artikel ini membahas tiga fokus utama: (1) hubungan ekstrakurikuler dan pengembangan karakter, (2) ekstrakurikuler sebagai pencegahan kenakalan remaja, dan (3) integrasi nilai-nilai Islam dalam kegiatan ekstrakurikuler. Hasil kajian menunjukkan bahwa kegiatan ekstrakurikuler yang dikelola dengan baik, didukung lingkungan sekolah, dan diintegrasikan dengan nilai-nilai Islam, dapat menurunkan kecenderungan kenakalan remaja, memperkuat rasa tanggung jawab, disiplin, dan identitas positif. Saran bagi sekolah adalah merancang program ekstrakurikuler yang sistematis, melibatkan pihak sekolah dan orang tua, serta memuat nilai-nilai karakter Islam untuk membentuk peserta didik yang berkarakter dan berdaya saing.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: Ekstrakurikuler, Kenakalan Remaja, Pendidikan Karakter, Nilai Islam</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Download : PDF</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Khodijah, S., Asiah, S., Kamaludin, D., Komalasari, W., Fitri, A., &amp; Diena, F. (2024). The&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Influence of Islamic Character Education in Extracurricular Activities on Strengthening Students’ Mental and Moral Aspects. JTUS, 2(12).</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Lestari, R. Y. (2016). Peran Kegiatan Ekstrakurikuler dalam Mengembangkan Watak Kewarganegaraan Peserta Didik di SMA Negeri 12 Semarang. UCEJ.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Pratama, S. P. (2020). Tingkat Kenakalan Remaja Peserta Ekstrakurikuler Sepakbola di SMP Negeri 3 Godean. Universitas Negeri Yogyakarta.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Rahayu, A. P., &amp; Dong, Y. (2023). The Relationship of Extracurricular Activities with Students’ Character Education and Determinant Factors: A Systematic Literature Review. Al-Ishlah: Jurnal Pendidikan, 15(1), 459-474.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Sutisna, U. (2023). Islamic Education Values in Extracurricular Activities. Journal of Advanced Islamic Educational Management.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Munaddhomah. (2024). Strategies for Strengthening Character Education in Islamic Boarding Schools Through Extracurricular Activities. Munaddhomah: Jurnal Manajemen Pendidikan Islam, 5(3), 354-366.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">(Artikel online) Zacky Al-Ghofir El-Muhtadi Rizal. (2024, October 29). Kegiatan Ekstrakurikuler Sebagai Usaha Menanggulangi Kenakalan Remaja. Kumparan.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">(Artikel berita) Akademisi Unpam. (2025, February 25). Ekskul Bisa Cegah Siswa dari Perilaku Kenakalan Remaja. Ujaran.co.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Bakhri, Syamsul, and Alan Sigit Fibrianto. \"Hubungan kegiatan ekstrakurikuler pramuka dengan tingkat religiusitas siswa sma negeri 1 tangen (perspektif teori sistem sosial talcott parsons).\"&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Jurnal Sosiologi Agama</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;12.1 (2018): 67-84. </span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Najili, H., Juhana, H., Hasanah, A., &amp; Arifin, B. S. (2022). Landasan teori pendidikan karakter.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">JIIP-Jurnal Ilmiah Ilmu Pendidikan</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">5</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(7), 2099-2107.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Rosyad, A. M., &amp; Khoiriyah, A. (2025). Integrasi Nilai-Nilai Islam dalam Pembelajaran Pendidikan Kewarganegaraan: Systematical Literature Review.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Journal Islamic Pedagogia</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">5</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(2), 110-124.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Fatchurahman, M. (2012). Kepercayaan diri, kematangan emosi, pola asuh orang tua demokratis dan kenakalan remaja.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Persona: Jurnal Psikologi Indonesia</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">1</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(2).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Rosidin, Angga, et al. \"Sosialisasi Pencegahan Kenakalan Remaja melalui Optimalisasi Ekstrakulikuler sebagai Wadah Pengembangan Karakter dan Masa Depan Menuju Indonesia Emas 2045.\"&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">WINDRADI: Jurnal Pengabdian Masyarakat</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;3.1 (2025): 16-34.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Azizah, F. K., &amp; Maknun, L. L. (2022). Pengembangan karakter dan keterampilan peserta didik melalui kegiatan ekstrakurikuler.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Tadzkirah: Jurnal Pendidikan Dasar</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">5</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(2), 1-15.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Masnawati, E., Darmawan, D., &amp; Masfufah, M. (2023). Peran ekstrakurikuler dalam membentuk karakter siswa.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Pusat Publikasi Ilmu Manajemen</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">1</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(4), 305-318.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:29:21', '2026-04-16 02:32:59', NULL, 0, NULL),
(12, 'Peran Tekanan Akademik Terhadap Perkembangan Mental Siswa', 'peran-tekanan-akademik-terhadap-perkembangan-mental-siswa', 'published', 'Purwa Sigit Nugrahanto', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII A - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Peran Tekanan Akademik Terhadap Perkembangan Mental Siswa</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Purwa Sigit Nugrahanto<strong>,</strong> Hadi Khaerudin, Annisa Tussholeha<sup> </sup></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">SMAIT AL FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">sigitnugrahanto186@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">This study aims to analyze the influence of academic pressure on children’s mental development while considering the role of academic achievement. Academic pressure arising from school demands and parental expectations often leads to stress, anxiety, and emotional disturbances in children. Through a literature review, it was found that academic pressure negatively affects mental development, especially in emotional stability and learning motivation. Children under excessive pressure tend to lose focus, enthusiasm, and self-confidence. Academic achievement acts both as a source of pressure and as an outcome influenced by the child’s mental condition. Therefore, maintaining a balance between academic expectations and mental health is essential to support optimal growth and overall well-being..</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Keywords: Academic Achievement Influence, Academic Pressure, Mental Development</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Penelitian ini bertujuan untuk mengetahui pengaruh tekanan akademik terhadap perkembangan mental anak dengan memperhatikan peran nilai akademik. Tekanan akademik yang bersumber dari tuntutan sekolah dan ekspektasi orang tua sering memicu stres, kecemasan, serta menurunnya motivasi belajar anak. Berdasarkan kajian literatur, tekanan akademik terbukti berpengaruh negatif terhadap perkembangan mental, terutama pada aspek emosional dan kepercayaan diri. Nilai akademik memiliki peran ganda, yaitu sebagai pemicu tekanan dan sebagai hasil yang dipengaruhi kondisi mental anak. Oleh karena itu, keseimbangan antara tuntutan akademik dan kesehatan mental perlu dijaga agar perkembangan anak berjalan optimal.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: Perkembangan Mental, Tekanan Akademik, Pengaruh Nilai Akademik.</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18lcFWqloeJIhmLyWnFeKhlO7faM2Ol__/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: black;\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>Babatunde, S. I., &amp; colleagues. (2025). Influence of academic pressure and sleep patterns on student well-being. Jurnal UNESA.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Hartono, A. (2022). Tekanan akademik dan kesehatan mental siswa SMA menjelang ujian. Jurnal Riset Kesehatan Nasional.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>Lee, X., Zhao, Y., &amp; Wang, C. (2024). Adolescent mental health and academic performance: A longitudinal relationship. Frontiers in Psychiatry, 15, 1176342.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>Ngadu, A. R. P. (2024). Academic stress leads issues for elementary students in Indonesia. International Conference on Education and Psychology, 2(1), 45–56.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Putri, M. (2021). Growth mindset dan penurunan stres akademik siswa SMA. Jurnal Ilmiah Edukatif</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Rahmawati, S. (2021). Pengaruh tekanan akademik terhadap prestasi akademik mahasiswa. Jurnal Psikologi Pendidikan Universitas Sebelas Maret, 9(2), 115–124.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\"> Retrieved from</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Santrock, J. W. (2020). Child Development (15th ed.). New York, NY: McGraw-Hill Education.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Steare, T., Baric, B., &amp; Klineberg, E. (2023). Systematic review: Association between academic pressure and adolescent depression, anxiety, and self-harm. Journal of Affective Disorders, 335, 20–35.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Wulansuci, G. (2021). Stres akademik anak usia dini: Pembelajaran CALISTUNG sebagai sumber tekanan belajar. Jurnal Golden Age: Jurnal Pendidikan Anak Usia Dini, 5(2), 87–97.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Yuniarti, D., Rahma, T., &amp; Ningsih, F. (2023). Hubungan antara tekanan akademik dan kesehatan mental pada siswa sekolah dasar di Kota Batu. Jurnal Keperawatan Poltekkes Mataram, 14(2), 101–110.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:38:01', '2026-04-16 02:42:18', NULL, 0, NULL),
(13, 'Deskripsi Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Pada Kesehatan Mental Remaja Dalam Perspektif Islam', 'deskripsi-lingkungan-pertemanan-toxic-pada-kesehatan-mental-remaja-dalam-perspektif-islam', 'published', 'Khairani Fatya Ichsan', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Deskripsi Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Pada Kesehatan Mental Remaja Dalam Perspektif Islam</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Khairani Fatya Ichsan, Hadi Khaerudin, Mutiah Hanifah</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\">khairaftich@gmail.com </span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Abstract</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">This study discusses the influence of toxic friendship environments on adolescents’ mental health from an Islamic perspective. Adolescence is a crucial developmental stage in which individuals build self-identity and social relationships, including friendships with peers. However, not all friendships provide positive effects. Toxic friendships, such as those involving manipulation, exclusion, and social pressure, can lead to stress, anxiety, and emotional instability. This research employs a descriptive qualitative method by analyzing relevant literature and journal sources. The findings indicate that toxic friendships have a negative impact on adolescents’ mental balance and may hinder their emotional and social development. From an Islamic point of view, friendship should be based on faith, morality, and mutual encouragement toward goodness. Therefore, adolescents are expected to be more selective in choosing friends and avoid relationships that can harm their faith and mental well-being.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Keywords: Toxic friendship, adolescent mental health, Islamic perspective, social relationship, morality.</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Penelitian ini membahas pengaruh lingkungan pertemanan toxic terhadap kesehatan mental remaja dalam perspektif Islam. Masa remaja merupakan tahap perkembangan penting di mana individu membangun identitas diri dan hubungan sosial, termasuk dengan teman sebaya. Namun, tidak semua pertemanan membawa dampak positif. Lingkungan pertemanan yang toxic, seperti adanya manipulasi, pengucilan, dan tekanan sosial, dapat menyebabkan stres, kecemasan, hingga gangguan emosional. Penelitian ini menggunakan metode deskriptif kualitatif dengan mengkaji berbagai sumber literatur dan jurnal yang relevan. Hasil kajian menunjukkan bahwa pertemanan toxic berpengaruh negatif terhadap keseimbangan mental remaja dan dapat menghambat perkembangan sosial mereka. Dalam pandangan Islam, pertemanan harus didasari oleh nilai iman, akhlak, dan saling menasihati dalam kebaikan. Oleh karena itu, remaja perlu lebih selektif dalam memilih teman dan menjauhi hubungan yang dapat merusak keimanan serta kesehatan mental</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: Pertemanan beracun, kesehatan mental remaja, perspektif Islam, hubungan sosial, akhlak.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ncnlKQVLRTpxnI57dNKueedSz7ggYizD/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Akib, Haedar. 2008. </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Kreatifitas dan inovasi: Tujuan Menapaki jalan yang dilalui Community of Practitioner</em><span style=\"color: black;\">. Jurnal bisnis dan Usahawan, volume 6. Nomor 2. Januari.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Zed, Mestika. 2003. </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan</em><span style=\"color: black;\">. Jakarta: Yayasan Obor Indonesia. </span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Abdillah, Rijal, and Muh Fauzan Nastiar, ‘Dampak Toxic Friendship Dan Strategi Antisipasi Dalam Pertemanan’, no. January (2025)</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Aliya Rohali, and Ike Utia Ningsih, ‘Dampak Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Berbasis Islam Pada Remaja’, <em>Journal of Islamic Psychology and Behavioral Sciences</em>, 3.3 (2025), pp. 91–101, doi:10.61994/jipbs.v3i3.1035</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Aulia, Nita, and Gina Anggaraini, ‘Deskripsi Toxic Parenting Dan Pengaruhnya Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Menurut Mahasiswa Universitas X Dalam Pandangan Islami’, <em>Journal Islamic Education</em>, 1.3 (2023), pp. 456–64 &lt;https://maryamsejahtera.com/index.php/Education/index&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Fadhilla, Rahmad, and Anggita Pratiwi Siregar, ‘Dampak Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Remaja’, <em>Invention: Journal Research and Education Studies</em>, 5.2 (2024), pp. 37–48 &lt;https://pusdikra-publishing.com/index.php/jres&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Hamidah, Rizka Nur, and Noneng Siti Rosidah, ‘Konsep Kesehatan Mental Remaja Perspektif Islam’, <em>Prophetic Guidance and Counseling Journal</em>, 2.1 (2021), pp. 26–33 &lt;http://ejournal.uika-bogor.ac.id/index.php/prophetic/index&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Nida, Haura Alfiyah, ‘Konsep Memilih Teman Yang Baik Menurut Hadits’, <em>Jurnal Riset Agama</em>, 1.2 (2021), pp. 338–53, doi:10.15575/jra.v1i2.14571</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Sadewa, Gilang, and others, ‘Upaya Penanganan Hubungan Toxic Dalam Pertemanan’, 05.02 (2025)</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Siska, Betry Afrin, and others, ‘Konsep Pertemanan Yang Baik Menurut Teori Psikologi Keislaman’, <em>ISTISYFA: Journal of Islamic Guidance and Counseling</em>, 2.3 (2024), pp. 319–26, doi:10.29300/istisyfa.v2i3.2440</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Abdillah, Rijal, and Muh Fauzan Nastiar, ‘Dampak Toxic Friendship Dan Strategi Antisipasi Dalam Pertemanan’, no. January (2025)</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Aliya Rohali, and Ike Utia Ningsih, ‘Dampak Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Berbasis Islam Pada Remaja’, <em>Journal of Islamic Psychology and Behavioral Sciences</em>, 3.3 (2025), pp. 91–101, doi:10.61994/jipbs.v3i3.1035</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Aulia, Nita, and Gina Anggaraini, ‘Deskripsi Toxic Parenting Dan Pengaruhnya Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Menurut Mahasiswa Universitas X Dalam Pandangan Islami’, <em>Journal Islamic Education</em>, 1.3 (2023), pp. 456–64 &lt;https://maryamsejahtera.com/index.php/Education/index&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Fadhilla, Rahmad, and Anggita Pratiwi Siregar, ‘Dampak Lingkungan Pertemanan Toxic Terhadap Kesehatan Mental Remaja’, <em>Invention: Journal Research and Education Studies</em>, 5.2 (2024), pp. 37–48 &lt;https://pusdikra-publishing.com/index.php/jres&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Hamidah, Rizka Nur, and Noneng Siti Rosidah, ‘Konsep Kesehatan Mental Remaja Perspektif Islam’, <em>Prophetic Guidance and Counseling Journal</em>, 2.1 (2021), pp. 26–33 &lt;http://ejournal.uika-bogor.ac.id/index.php/prophetic/index&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Nida, Haura Alfiyah, ‘Konsep Memilih Teman Yang Baik Menurut Hadits’, <em>Jurnal Riset Agama</em>, 1.2 (2021), pp. 338–53, doi:10.15575/jra.v1i2.14571</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Sadewa, Gilang, and others, ‘Upaya Penanganan Hubungan Toxic Dalam Pertemanan’, 05.02 (2025)</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Siska, Betry Afrin, and others, ‘Konsep Pertemanan Yang Baik Menurut Teori Psikologi Keislaman’, <em>ISTISYFA: Journal of Islamic Guidance and Counseling</em>, 2.3 (2024), pp. 319–26, doi:10.29300/istisyfa.v2i3.2440</p><p><br></p><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/Asus/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\"><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:41:39', '2026-04-16 02:41:39', NULL, 0, NULL),
(14, 'Studi Pustaka Tentang Fenomena FoMO (Fear of Missing Out)', 'studi-pustaka-tentang-fenomena-fomo-fear-of-missing-out', 'published', 'Rahajeng Rahadatul ‘Aisy', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Studi Pustaka Tentang Fenomena FoMO (<em>Fear of Missing Out</em>)</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Rahajeng Rahadatul ‘Aisy<strong>, </strong>Hadi Khaerudin<sup>, </sup>Puput Dwi Rahayu</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><a href=\"mailto:rahajengaisy@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: blue;\">rahajengaisy@gmail.com</a></p><p>      </p><p>  <span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">The rapid development of digital technology and social media has affected the social interactions and psychological well-being of adolescents. One psychological phenomenon that arises due to excessive social media use is Fear of Missing Out (FOMO), which is a feeling of anxiety and fear of being left behind in other people\'s social experiences or activities. This study uses a literature study method by analyzing various journals and relevant research to understand the meaning, causes, impacts, and strategies for overcoming Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) in adolescents. The results of the study indicate that Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) is influenced by the extent of social media use, the need for social recognition, self-esteem, and the influence of digital culture. Its impacts include increased anxiety, stress, decreased concentration in learning, and weakened social relationships in the real world. In the Islamic perspective, Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) can be seen as a test of patience as mentioned in QS. Al-Baqarah verse 155. Strengthening media literacy, self-control, and spiritual awareness are important strategies to reduce Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) among adolescents.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords:&nbsp;</strong><em style=\"color: black;\">social media, social anxiety, psychological well-being, young generation, media literacy.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Download: </em></strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xQifJ8lJ66Q5tkp018pmMRYxyVpF0bEX/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: black;\"><strong><em>PDF</em></strong></a></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Referensi</em></strong></p><p>Ali, Chantika, Vika Nurfitria Noviana, Ahmad Nurrohim, and Universitas Muhammadiyah Surakarta, ‘Takut Ketinggalan Tren : Pandangan Al- Qur ’ an t Entang Fomo Anak Muda Zaman Sekarang Dan Implikasi Bagi Pendidikan Karakter Islami’, 9 (2025), 22255–61</p><p>Chika, Silksya, and Zaki Nur Fahmawati, ‘Pengaruh Self Control Dan Fear of Missing Out ( FOMO ) Terhadap Adiksi Media Sosial Pada Generasi Z The Influence of Self-Control and Fear of Missing Out ( FOMO ) In Social Media Addiction on Generation Z Pendahuluan’, 7 (2024), 449–64</p><p>Dewi, Dinie Anggraeni, Solihin Ichas Hamid, Farah Annisa, and Monica Octafianti, ‘Menumbuhkan Karakter Siswa Melalui Pemanfaatan Literasi Digital Dinie Anggraeni Dewi<sup>1</sup>, Solihin Ichas Hamid<sup>2</sup>, Farah Annisa<sup>3</sup>, Monica Octafianti <sup>4</sup> , Pingkan Regi Genika 5 ’, 5 (2021), 5249–57</p><p>Indonesia, Universitas Pendidikan, ‘Almira Rahma Fadhila’, 7693 (2024), 137–50</p><p>Mestika Zed, ‘Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan’, <em>Yayasan Obor Indonesia, Jakarta</em>, 2008, 42–52</p><p>Muzhar, Wildah Muhsanah, Anna Wati, and Dewi Purba, ‘Jurnal Islamika Granada’, 4 (2024), 132–38</p><p>Nadzirah, Salma, Wahidah Fitriani, and Putri Yeni, ‘Dampak Sindrom FoMO Terhadap Interaksi Sosial Pada Remaja’, <em>Intelegensia : Jurnal Pendidikan Islam</em>, 10 (2022), 54–69 &lt;https://doi.org/10.34001/intelegensia.v10i1.3350&gt;</p><p>Panggabean Chrystian Nik, ‘1930-11723-1-Pb (1)’, <em>Southeast Asian Journal of Technology and Science</em>, 2 (2021), 1–5</p><p>Przybylski, Andrew K, Kou Murayama, Cody R Dehaan, and Valerie Gladwell, ‘Com Puters in Human Behavior Motivational , Emotional , and Behavioral Correlates of Fear of Missing Out’, <em>Computers in Human Behavior</em>, 29 (2013), 1841–48 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chb.2013.02.014&gt;</p><p>Septia Wardani, Diah Sinta, and Resita Cahyani, ‘Pengaruh FoMO (Fear of Missing Out) Pada Generasi Z Terhadap Ketakwaan Kepada Allah SWT.’, <em>Darul Ilmi: Jurnal Ilmu Kependidikan Dan Keislaman</em>, 11 (2024), 257–69 &lt;https://doi.org/10.24952/di.v11i2.10469&gt;</p><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/Asus/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\" width=\"4\" height=\"6\"><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:46:44', '2026-04-16 02:46:44', NULL, 0, NULL),
(15, 'Transformasi Kecemasan Modern Menjadi Ketakwaan: Dari Fomo Menjadi Fear Of Allah', 'transformasi-kecemasan-modern-menjadi-ketakwaan-dari-fomo-menjadi-fear-of-allah', 'published', 'Fatiha Cinta', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Transformasi Kecemasan Modern Menjadi Ketakwaan: Dari Fomo Menjadi Fear Of Allah</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Fatiha Cinta, Hadi Khaerudin, Mutiah Hanifah</strong>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">fatihacinta536@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">The phenomenon of Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) is a form of social anxiety that is widespread in the digital era, especially among younger generations. FOMO causes individuals to feel anxious and fearful of missing social opportunities that seem important according to social media standards, thereby leading to stress and inner unrest. The purpose of this journal is to evaluate the transformation of this anxiety into piety (fear of Allah) through a thematic interpretation of the Qur\'an and Islamic psychology. The research method uses a literature study by examining Qur\'anic verses related to fear (khauf) and sadness (huzn) as well as the Prophet\'s hadiths. This study also explores Islamic strategies </em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Keywords</em></strong><em style=\"color: black;\">: FOMO, Piety, Khauf, Character Education.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">Fenomena Fear of Missing Out (FOMO) adalah salah satu bentuk kecemasan sosial yang meluas di era digital, khususnya dalam kalangan generasi muda. FOMO membuat individu merasa cemas dan takut kehilangan kesempatan sosial yang tampak penting menurut standar media sosial, sehingga menimbulkan stres dan keresahan batin</em><sup style=\"color: black;\"><em>. </em></sup><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;Tujuan dari jurnal ini adalah untuk mengevaluasi transformasi kecemasan tersebut menjadi ketakwaan (fear of Allah) melalui pendekatan tafsir tematik Al-Qur’an dan psikologi Islam. Metode penelitian menggunakan studi pustaka dengan menelaah ayatayat Al-Qur’an yang berkaitan dengan ketakutan (khauf) dan kesedihan (huzn) serta hadist Nabi. Kajian ini juga mengeksplorasi strategi islami seperti dzikrullah, sabar, dan syukur untuk mencapai ketenangan batin. Hasil kajian menegaskan bahwa ketakwaan kepada Allah SWT merupakan jalan utama untuk mengatasi kecemasan modern dan membentuk karakter spiritual yang kuat. Implikasi penelitian ini sangat penting dalam konteks pendidikan karakter di era digital.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Kata Kunci :</em></strong><em style=\"color: black;\"> FOMO, Ketakwaan, Khauf, Pendidikan Karakter.</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lxdVGSjgAP6fXvG0yxePOoK9B6BSvdHA/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Ali, Chantika, Vika Nurfitria Noviana, and Ahmad Nurrohim, <em>Takut Ketinggalan Tren: Pandangan Al-Qur’an Tentang Fomo Anak Muda Zaman Sekarang Dan Implikasi Bagi Pendidikan Karakter Islami</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Fitri, Hidayatul, Dyta Setiawati Hariyono, and Ghea Amalia Arpandy, ‘Pengaruh Self-Esteem Terhadap Fear Of Missing Out (Fomo) Pada Generasi Z Pengguna Media Sosial’, <em>Jurnal Psikologi</em>, 1 (2024), 21 &lt;https://doi.org/10.47134/pjp.v1i4.2823&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Gündüz Oruç, Fatma, and Gülden Atan, ‘The Interplay between Self-Esteem and Social Anxiety in Adults with Epilepsy: The Role of Seizure Frequency’, <em>Epilepsy &amp; Behavior</em>, 173 (2025), 110764 &lt;https://doi.org/https://doi.org/10.1016/j.yebeh.2025.110764&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Hanif, Daffa, and Universitas Widyatama, ‘Keterkaitan Antara Pencarian Validasi Diri Dan Literasi Digital Pada Generasi Muda’, 2025</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Milyavskaya, Marina, Mark Saffran, Nora Hope, and Richard Koestner, ‘Fear of Missing out: Prevalence, Dynamics, and Consequences of Experiencing FOMO’, <em>Motivation and Emotion</em>, 42 (2018), 725–37 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1007/s11031-018-9683-5&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Naufal, Haickal Attallah, ‘Literasi Digital’, <em>Perspektif</em>, 1 (2021), 195–202 &lt;https://doi.org/10.53947/perspekt.v1i2.32&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Piko, Bettina F, Vanessa Müller, Hedvig Kiss, and David Mellor, ‘Acta Psychologica Exploring Contributors to FoMO ( Fear of Missing out ) among University Students : The Role of Social Comparison , Social Media Addiction , Loneliness ’, <em>Acta Psychologica</em>, 253 (2025), 104771 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1016/j.actpsy.2025.104771&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Prastia, Tissa Adelia, Herlan Praktiko, and Suhadianto, ‘Kecemasan Sosial Pada Remaja Pengguna Media Sosial: Menguji Peranan Body Image’, <em>INNER: Journal of Psychological Research</em>, 2 (2023), 951–58</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Ramdani, Dede Ahmad, Aan Hasanah, and Bambang Samsul Arifin, ‘Core Ethical Values Pendidikan Karakter Berbasis Nilai-Nilai Islam’, <em>JIIP - Jurnal Ilmiah Ilmu Pendidikan</em>, 6 (2023), 7891–99 &lt;https://doi.org/10.54371/jiip.v6i10.3010&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Setiawan, Farid, Annisa Septarea Hutami, Dias Syahrul Riyadi, Virandra Adhe Arista, and Yoga Handis Al Dani, ‘Kebijakan Penguatan Pendidikan Karakter Melalui Pendidikan Agama Islam’, <em>Al-Mudarris (Jurnal Ilmiah Pendidikan Islam)</em>, 4 (2021), 1–22 &lt;https://doi.org/10.23971/mdr.v4i1.2809&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Ushuluddin, Fakultas, D A N Pemikiran, Universitas Islam Negeri, and Sunan Kalijaga, ‘Erwin Kusumastuti’, 2014</p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:51:31', '2026-04-16 02:51:31', NULL, 0, NULL);
