(16, 'Pentingnya Kejujuran Dalam Ruang Lingkup Siswa Belajar', 'pentingnya-kejujuran-dalam-ruang-lingkup-siswa-belajar', 'published', 'Muhammad Fadhilah Chaesarudin', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII A - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Pentingnya Kejujuran Dalam Ruang Lingkup Siswa Belajar</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Muhammad Fadhilah Chaesarudin,&nbsp;Hadi khaerudin, Niken Larasati</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT ALFIDAA</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Selatan; Jawa Barat 17510</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><a href=\"mailto:E-mail=chaesaruddinf@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(70, 120, 134);\"><strong>E-mail=chaesaruddinf@gmail.com</strong></a></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong><em>Abstract</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em>This study aims to analyze and describe the urgency of fundamentally instilling honesty values ​​in students\' educational environments. Honesty is a crucial ethical pillar, not only shaping individual moral character but also influencing the quality of the teaching and learning process and the integrity of academic outcomes. This study identifies that dishonest practices, such as cheating, plagiarism, and data falsification, can undermine the true goals of education. The method used is a qualitative literature review with a focus on the impact of honesty on intrinsic motivation, learning independence, and the validity of evaluations. The results of the study indicate that a learning environment that upholds honesty will foster authentic self-confidence, responsibility, and critical thinking skills in students. From an Islamic perspective, honesty (ṣidq) is seen as a fundamental moral value that reflects the quality of a Muslim\'s faith and integrity. In addition, Islam commands to avoid lying, fulfill promises, and maintain trust. Thus, the integration of honesty values ​​according to Islamic teachings can strengthen the educational goal of forming students with character, responsibility, and high moral integrity. The conclusions of this study emphasize the need for collaboration between teachers, parents, and educational institutions to create a transparent and ethical academic culture. Implementing a clear code of ethics and consistently leading by example are key to ensuring honesty becomes a core value inherent in every student.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong><em>Keywords: Honesty, Academic Ethics, Students, Learning Environment, Integrity.</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Penelitian ini bertujuan menganalisis urgensi penanaman nilai kejujuran dalam lingkungan pendidikan siswa. Kejujuran sebagai pilar etika berperan penting dalam membentuk karakter moral, menjaga kualitas proses belajar, serta menjamin integritas hasil akademik. Tinjauan literatur kualitatif menunjukkan bahwa perilaku tidak jujur seperti menyontek, plagiarisme, dan pemalsuan data dapat merusak tujuan pendidikan dan menghambat perkembangan kemandirian belajar, motivasi intrinsik, serta keabsahan evaluasi. Dalam perspektif Islam, kejujuran <em>(ṣidq)</em> dipandang sebagai akhlak fundamental yang berkaitan erat dengan iman, amanah, dan komitmen untuk menjauhi kebohongan. Integrasi nilai kejujuran menurut ajaran Islam dapat memperkuat pembentukan karakter siswa yang bertanggung jawab dan berintegritas. Penelitian ini menegaskan perlunya kolaborasi antara guru, orang tua, dan institusi pendidikan dalam membangun budaya akademik yang etis, didukung oleh implementasi kode etik yang jelas serta keteladanan yang konsisten.</p><p>Kata Kunci: Kejujuran, Etika Akademik, Siswa, Lingkungan Belajar, Integritas.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FyMTeI_T4543fUDDqNAhDY0bDOdrBqw1/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Akib, Haedar. 2008. <em>Kreatifitas dan inovasi: Tujuan Menapaki jalan yang dilalui Community of Practitioner</em>. Jurnal bisnis dan Usahawan, volume 6. Nomor 2. Januari</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Al-Qur’an, Al-ahzab: (70:33), dalam Al-Qur’an dan Terjemahannya, Kementerian Agama Republik Indonesia (Jakarta: Lajnah Pentashihan Mushaf Al-Qur’an, 2019), h. 49.</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Çelik, Özgür, and Salim Razı, ‘Facilitators and Barriers to Creating a Culture of Academic Integrity at Secondary Schools: An Exploratory Case Study’, <em>International Journal for Educational Integrity</em>, 19 (2023), 1–30 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1007/s40979-023-00125-4&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Damanik, Muhammad Zein, and Alamiah Warda Putri, Dhea Melati, Mutia, ‘Dalil Jujur Dalam Perkataan Dan Perbuatan’, <em>At-Tarbiyah Jurnal Penelitian Dan Pendidikan Agama Islam</em>, 2 (2024), 554–64</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Dita Puspita Dewi, and Mad Ali, ‘Analysis of Philosophy Studies: Integration of the Value of Honesty in the Educational Curriculum’, <em>Journal of Practice Learning and Educational Development</em>, 5 (2025), 620–29 &lt;https://doi.org/10.58737/jpled.v5i2.482&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Fadillah, ‘Kejujuran Salah Satu Pendongkrak Pendidikan Karakter Di Sekolah’, <em>Jurnal Visi Ilmu Pendidikan</em>, 9 (2012), 968–80</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Isa Abdullah, ‘Menanamkan Sikap Kejujuran Pada Siswa’, <em>TARUNAEDU: Journal of Education and Learning</em>, 01 (2023), 95–103 &lt;https://journal.staitaruna.ac.id/index.php/jel/article/view/116&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Marlina, Elin, Salwa Azzahra, and Ratna Sari Dewi, ‘Strategi Efektif Menanamkan Nilai Kejujuran Pada Generasi Muda Melalui Pendidikan Karakter’, <em>Ainara Journal (Jurnal Penelitian Dan PKM Bidang Ilmu Pendidikan)</em>, 5 (2024), 326–30 &lt;https://doi.org/10.54371/ainj.v5i3.555&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Normalasarie, Normalasarie, ‘Penguatan Karakter Kejujuran Pada Siswa Sekolah Dasar Melalui Nilai-Nilai Budaya Lokal Banjar’, <em>ALACRITY : Journal of Education</em>, 5 (2025), 201–12 &lt;https://doi.org/10.52121/alacrity.v5i1.565&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Reffiane, Fine, Henry Januar Saputra, and Taufik Hidayat, ‘Identifikasi Tingkat Kejujuran Siswa Sekolah Dasar Melalui Gerobak Kejujuran Di Kota Semarang’, <em>Mimbar Sekolah Dasar</em>, 2 (2016), 73–79 &lt;https://doi.org/10.17509/mimbar-sd.v2i1.1323&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Reinhardt, Nina, Lina Marie Trnka, and Marc André Reinhard, ‘The Correlation of Honesty-Humility and Learning Goals with Academic Cheating’, <em>Social Psychology of Education</em>, 26 (2023), 211–26 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1007/s11218-022-09742-2&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Zed, Mestika. 2003. <em>Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan</em>. Jakarta: Yayasan Obor Indonesia</p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 02:56:19', '2026-04-16 02:56:19', NULL, 0, NULL),
(17, 'Peran Komunikasi Terbuka Orang Tua Sebagai Faktor Pembentuk Kestabilan Emosi Remaja', 'peran-komunikasi-terbuka-orang-tua-sebagai-faktor-pembentuk-kestabilan-emosi-remaja', 'published', 'Aisyah Qonita Zahida', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Peran Komunikasi Terbuka Orang Tua Sebagai Faktor Pembentuk Kestabilan Emosi Remaja</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Aisyah Qonita Zahida, Hadi Khaerudin<sup>, </sup>Fitri Rahmaniyar</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">aisyahqonita30@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">Communication between parents and children is a crucial factor in shaping a child\'s personality and emotional stability. Adolescence, as a transitional phase from childhood to adulthood, is marked by various physical, cognitive, and emotional changes that require support from the family environment. Open communication is an effective form of interaction in meeting these emotional needs. Through honest, two-way, and empathetic communication, children feel heard, understood, and accepted for who they are. This helps children develop a sense of security, self-confidence, and the ability to manage their emotions healthily. Conversely, closed or authoritarian communication patterns can lead to psychological stress and emotional instability in children. Therefore, open communication plays a crucial role in building a harmonious relationship between parents and children and serves as the foundation for emotional well-being during adolescence.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Keywords: open communication, parents, adolescence, emotional intelligence</em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<span style=\"color: black;\">Komunikasi antara orang tua dan anak merupakan faktor penting dalam pembentukan kepribadian dan kestabilan emosi anak. Masa remaja sebagai fase transisi dari kanak-kanak menuju dewasa ditandai dengan berbagai perubahan fisik, kognitif, dan emosional yang memerlukan dukungan dari lingkungan keluarga. Komunikasi terbuka menjadi salah satu bentuk interaksi yang efektif dalam memenuhi kebutuhan emosional tersebut. Melalui komunikasi yang jujur, dua arah, dan penuh empati, anak merasa didengar, dipahami, serta diterima apa adanya. Kondisi ini membantu anak mengembangkan rasa aman, kepercayaan diri, dan kemampuan mengelola emosi secara sehat. Sebaliknya, pola komunikasi yang tertutup atau otoriter dapat menimbulkan tekanan psikologis dan ketidakstabilan emosi pada anak. Oleh karena itu, komunikasi terbuka berperan penting dalam membangun hubungan yang harmonis antara orang tua dan anak, serta menjadi dasar terbentuknya kesejahteraan emosional pada masa remaja</span><strong style=\"color: black;\">.</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: komunikasi terbuka, orang tua, remaja, kestabilan emosi, pola asuh</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17GMn9Zvt7xwFyzBxNZV8WjsTR7YnKnqy/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p>Andika Putra, ‘Dampak Peran Orang Tua Terhadap Perkembangan Sosial Dan Emosional Anak’, 2024, 1–14</p><p>Dakwah, Fakultas, Universitas Ibrahimy, and Sukorejo Situbondo, ‘Peran Keberfungsian Sistem Keluarga Pada Regulasi Emosi Remaja’, 1 (2019), 82–93</p><p>Defaza, Agla, and Wulansari Vitaloka, ‘Rahasia Keberhasilan Sosial Emosional Anak : Keluarga Sebagai Faktor Kunci’, 8 (2025), 111–23</p><p>Hasibuan, Nur Aisyah, ‘Etika Komunikasi Interpersonal Orang Tua Dan Anak Dalam Surah Luqman Ayat 12-19 INSTITUT AGAMA ISLAM NEGERI ( IAIN )’, 2015</p><p>Hidayah, Nurul, Lintang Sari, Fajar Yousrihatin, and Wulida Litaqia, ‘Gambaran Kesehatan Mental Emosional Remaja’, 12 (2023), 2721–8007</p><p>Indonesia, Yayasan Obor, ‘Mestika Zed, Op-Cit, Hlm. 3’, 2008, 42–52</p><p>Khusniyah, Nurul Lailatul, ‘Peran Orang Tua Sebagai Pembentuk Emosional Sosial Anak’, 2018, 87–102</p><p>Lopis. S, Yorhans, Hubungan Komunikasi Orang Tua Dan Anak Dengan Pembentukan Konsep Diri Anak Remaja</p><p>Muttaqin, Zainul, Universitas Hamzanwadi, and Indonesia Azmussya’ni;, ‘Menilik Bentuk Komunikasi Antara Anak Dan Orang Tua’</p><p>No, Vol, ‘Analisis Peran Keluarga Dalam Pembentukan Perkembangan Emosional Anak Usia Dini’, 3 (2025), 38–49</p><p>Ramadhana, M.R, ‘Keterbukaan Diri Dalam Komunikasi Orangtua-Anak Pada Remaja Pola Asuh Orangtua Authoritarian’, 2018</p><p>Wahyuti Dan Leonita, Tri, Korelasi Antara Keakraban Anak Dan Orangtua, Jurnal Visi Komunikasi, 2016, XV</p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:01:14', '2026-04-16 03:01:14', NULL, 0, NULL),
(18, 'Dampak Penggunaan Media Sosial Tiktok Terhadap Gaya Berpakaian Remaja', 'dampak-penggunaan-media-sosial-tiktok-terhadap-gaya-berpakaian-remaja', 'published', 'Najwa Farah Raasyidah', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Dampak Penggunaan Media Sosial Tiktok Terhadap Gaya Berpakaian Remaja </strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Najwa Farah Raasyidah, Hadi Khaerudin, Ratna Ria Sari</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><sup style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</sup><span style=\"color: black;\">najwafarahraasyidah@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Abstract </em></strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">The rise of social media has greatly influenced teenagers’ lifestyles, especially in how they dress. One of the most influential platforms today is TikTok, which has become a space for self-expression and a source of fashion inspiration. This study aims to explore how TikTok affects teenagers’ fashion styles. The research uses a library research method by collecting data from books, journals, and relevant online sources. The findings show that TikTok has both positive and negative effects. On the positive side, TikTok helps teenagers become more creative, confident, and aware of global fashion trends. On the negative side, it can lead to consumptive behavior, imitation of influencers’ styles, and reduced originality in dressing. Therefore, digital literacy and parental guidance are needed to help teenagers use TikTok wisely and adapt fashion trends to their personality and cultural values.</em></p><p><strong>Keywords:</strong><em> TikTok, fashion style, teenagers, social media, fashion</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Perkembangan media sosial membawa banyak perubahan dalam kehidupan remaja, terutama dalam cara mereka berpenampilan. Salah satu platform yang paling berpengaruh adalah TikTok, yang kini menjadi tempat remaja mengekspresikan diri sekaligus mencari inspirasi fashion. Penelitian ini bertujuan untuk mengetahui bagaimana penggunaan TikTok </span>mempengaruhi<span style=\"color: black;\"> gaya berpakaian remaja. Penelitian dilakukan dengan metode studi kepustakaan </span><em style=\"color: black;\">(library research)</em><span style=\"color: black;\">, yaitu dengan mengumpulkan data dari berbagai buku, jurnal, dan sumber online yang relevan. Hasil penelitian menunjukkan bahwa TikTok memiliki pengaruh positif dan negatif. Di sisi positif, TikTok membantu remaja menjadi lebih kreatif, percaya diri, dan mengenal tren fashion global. Namun, di sisi negatif, TikTok dapat membuat remaja menjadi konsumtif, meniru gaya influencer tanpa memikirkan nilai budaya, serta mengurangi keaslian dalam berpakaian. Karena itu, diperlukan literasi digital dan bimbingan dari orang tua agar remaja bisa menggunakan TikTok secara bijak serta menyesuaikan tren fashion dengan kepribadian dan budaya yang ada.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong>Kata Kunci</strong>: TikTok, gaya berpakaian, remaja, media sosial, fashion</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KatRWpdCkZgoN9rSq4MFETDgXFadIcgU/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Awanda, Y., Harahap, N., Yoga, W., Siregar, S. F., Ananda, R., &amp; Afifah, N. (2024). The Influence of Tiktok Social Media on Teenagers\' Lifestyles.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">AMK: Abdi Masyarakat UIKA</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">3</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(2), 66-69.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Azizah, R., Ananda, R. S., &amp; Faristiana, A. R. (2023). Dampak Tiktok Terhadap Gaya Hidup Remaja Perempuan.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Student Scientific Creativity Journal</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">1</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(4), 399-414.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Asdianti, A. (2024).&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">PENGARUH MEDIA SOSIAL TIKTOK TERHADAP FASHION STYLE MAHASISWA ILMU KOMUNIKASI UNIVERSITAS MALIKUSSALEH</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;(Doctoral dissertation, Universitas Malikussaleh).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Fatikh, M. A., &amp; Muhammad, F. I. (2024). Pengaruh Tiktok Terhadap Trend Fashion Pada Mahasiswa di Mojokerto.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">J-KIs: Jurnal Komunikasi Islam</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">5</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(2), 211-220.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Hadiapurwa, A., Nugraha, H., &amp; Ramdani, N. (2021). Potensi pemanfaatan media sosial tiktok sebagai media pembelajaran dalam pembelajaran daring.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Akademika</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">10</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(02), 425-436.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Ilyas, V. (2024).&nbsp;Dampak Penggunaan Aplikasi TikTok Terhadap Tren Berpakaian Muslimah Mahasiswa FUAD IAIN Parepare&nbsp;(Doctoral dissertation, IAIN Parepare).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Kis, M., Fitriani, W., &amp; Irawati, M. (2024). Analisis dampak penggunaan aplikasi TikTok pada remaja: A systematic literature review.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Counselia; Jurnal Bimbingan Konseling Pendidikan Islam</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">5</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(1), 227-238.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Putri, R. P. (2024).&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Analisis Media Sosial Tiktok terhadap Etika Berpakaian Islami Remaja Putri Desa Timbulrejo Kecamatan Bangunrejo Lampung Tengah</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">&nbsp;(Doctoral dissertation, IAIN Metro).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Patadungan, I., Asyahra, N., Febriandini, F., Fajar, A., Coppo, A. N. A., &amp; Sahabuddin, R. (2025). Pengaruh Konten Fashion Tiktok Terhadap Keinginan Konsumen Membeli Pakaian dengan Mediasi Fomo.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Jurnal Interdisipliner</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">1</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(6), 44-55.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Sinaga, S. C., &amp; Mailin, M. (2023). Pengaruh Aplikasi Tiktok Terhadap Perubahan Gaya Hidup dan Pola Pikir Masyarakat di Silau Bayu Kecamatan Gunung Maligas.&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Al Qalam: Jurnal Ilmiah Keagamaan dan Kemasyarakatan</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">,&nbsp;</span><em style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">17</em><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">(5), 3426-3435.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Zed, Mestika. 2003. </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan</em><span style=\"color: black;\">. Jakarta: Yayasan Obor Indonesia.</span></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:04:56', '2026-04-16 03:05:35', NULL, 0, NULL),
(19, 'Peran Pendidikan Dalam Mencegah Dampak Negatif Maraknya Judi Online Pada Generasi Muda', 'peran-pendidikan-dalam-mencegah-dampak-negatif-maraknya-judi-online-pada-generasi-muda', 'published', 'Khaizuran Nur Fathirullah', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII A - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Peran Pendidikan Dalam Mencegah Dampak Negatif Maraknya Judi Online Pada Generasi Muda</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Khaizuran Nur Fathirullah, Hadi Khaerudin, Tri Setyanto</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><a href=\"mailto:k.n.fathirullah@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(5, 99, 193);\">k.n.fathirullah@gmail.com</a><sup style=\"color: black;\">1</sup></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">The rapid development of digital technology has had a significant impact on the younger generation, including the increasing involvement of youth in online gambling. Low levels of digital literacy and weak character education are major factors that make adolescents vulnerable to the negative influences of the digital world. This study aims to analyze the role of education in preventing the negative impacts of online gambling through the strengthening of character and digital literacy. The literature review shows that character education helps instill moral values, responsibility, and discipline, while digital literacy enables young people to think critically and use technology wisely. The integration of these two aspects allows students to become not only digitally competent but also morally aware in facing the temptations of online gambling.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords :character education, digital literacy, online gambling, young generation</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Perkembangan teknologi digital membawa dampak besar bagi generasi muda, termasuk meningkatnya keterlibatan mereka dalam judi online. Rendahnya literasi digital dan lemahnya pendidikan karakter menjadi faktor utama yang membuat remaja rentan terhadap pengaruh negatif dunia digital. Penelitian ini bertujuan menganalisis peran pendidikan dalam mencegah dampak negatif judi online melalui penguatan karakter dan literasi digital.Hasil kajian literatur menunjukkan bahwa pendidikan karakter mampu menanamkan nilai moral, tanggung jawab, dan kedisiplinan, sedangkan literasi digital membantu generasi muda berpikir kritis dan bijak dalam menggunakan teknologi. Integrasi keduanya menjadikan peserta didik tidak hanya cerdas digital, tetapi juga memiliki kesadaran moral dalam menghadapi godaan judi online.</em></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: </strong><span style=\"color: black;\">pendidikan karakter, literasi digital, judi online, generasi muda</span></p><img src=\"file:///C:/Users/Asus/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.gif\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\"><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1R4Ofwvsrf7o1Grmx0PFEC5aeikqvReiu/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Afrioza, Selvy, Ilham Jaya Sakti, Alifia Lintang Febrianti, Ridha Achmal Hamdani, Bisnis Digital, and Universitas Yatsi Madani, ‘LITERASI DIGITAL ADAPTIF SEBAGAI STRATEGI PENCEGAHAN JUDI ONLINE DAN PENGUATAN KETAHANAN REMAJA : STUDI KASUS DI’, 2 (2025), 75–84</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">At-thohiriyyah, Kasus Siswa S M A, ‘Strategi Peningkatan Literasi Digital Dalam Mencegah Judi Online Di Kalangan Siswa : Perspektif Dari Studi’, 8 (2025), 1066–73</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Ayub, Syahrial, and Husnul Fuadi, ‘Pentingnya Pendidikan Karakter Bagi Generasi Z Di Era Digital’, 9 (2024), 3063–67</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Hasanah, Uswatun, Eka Putri Prasasti, Evi Febriani, and Ida Faridatul Hasanah, ‘Membangun Karakter Generasi Digital Melalui Literasi Digital Perspektif Pendidikan Islam’, <em>Equilibrium: Jurnal Pendidikan</em>, 12 (2024), 138–44 &lt;https://doi.org/10.26618/equilibrium.v12i2.14116&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Lampung, Bandar, and Melalui Aplikasi, ‘Jurnal Pengabdian Masyarakat’, 2 (2025), 822–27</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Raja, Marselinus, and Harry Yulianto, ‘Determinan Sosio-Ekonomi Dan Teknologis Penyebab Kecanduan Judi Online Pada Generasi Muda Di Wilayah Urban Socio-Economic and Technological Determinants of Online Gambling Addiction among the Youth in Urban Areas’, 2025, 4066–77</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Rajab, Abdul, Dedi Harianto, Syahir Fadli, Dwi Utami, and Sri Utami, ‘Melindungi Generasi Muda Dari Jeratan Judi Online Melalui Kegiatan Edukasi Dan Solusi’, 3 (2025), 748–55</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Ramadandi, Frendi, and Nurul Huda, ‘Membangun Kesadaran Digital Tentang Dampak Negatif Bahaya Judi Online Terhadap Remaja SMP YP Ar-Rachma Kecamatan Tanjung Lago Kabupaten Banyuasin’, 3 (2025), 2048–53</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Saefullah, Rifki, and Sundarapandian Vaidyanatahan, ‘The Impact of Ease of Digital Access on the Increase in Online Gambling Cases Among Students’, 5 (2025), 37–45</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Septanto, Henri, Uus Rusmawan, Boy Yuliadi, and Ari Hidayatullah, ‘Study of the Role of Digital Literacy in Mitigating the Spread of Online Gambling as a Popular Cyber Crime in Indonesia’, 5 (2024), 5048–54</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Syekh, Iain, Nurjati Cirebon, and Cirebon Email, ‘LITERASI DIGITAL SEBAGAI PENGUATAN PENDIDIKAN KARAKTER MENUJU ERA SOCIETY 5.0 Bambang Yuniarto, Rivo Panji Yudha’, X (1945), 176–94</p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:09:15', '2026-04-16 03:09:15', NULL, 0, NULL),
(20, 'Tinjauan Literatur Tentang Kepercayaan Diri Anak Fatherless', 'tinjauan-literatur-tentang-kepercayaan-diri-anak-fatherless', 'published', 'Farah Salsabila', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Tinjauan Literatur Tentang Kepercayaan Diri Anak Fatherless</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Farah Salsabila, Hadi Khaerudin, Fernindy Fitra Gumanti</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">sabila.farah12@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">Family is the first environment that plays an important role in shaping a child’s character and personality. One of the main figures in the family is the father, who has a significant role in the child’s emotional, social, and self-confidence development. However, the phenomenon of fatherlessness, or the absence of a father either physically or emotionally, is increasingly common and has an impact on a child’s growth and development. This study aims to examine the influence of the absence of a father figure on a child’s self-confidence. This research uses a library research method by collecting data from scientific journals and other relevant sources. The findings show that the absence of a father negatively affects the development of a child’s self-confidence, which is characterized by low self-esteem, lack of motivation, and difficulty in recognizing.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords: fatherless, father’s role, child’s self-confidence, child’s development</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Keluarga merupakan lingkungan pertama yang berperan penting dalam pembentukan karakter dan kepribadian anak. Salah satu figur utama dalam keluarga adalah ayah, yang memiliki peran penting dalam perkembangan emosional, sosial, dan kepercayaan diri anak. Namun, fenomena </span><em>fatherless</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> atau ketidakhadiran ayah baik secara fisik maupun emosional kini semakin banyak terjadi dan berdampak pada tumbuh kembang anak. Penelitian ini bertujuan untuk meninjau pengaruh ketiadaan figur ayah terhadap kepercayaan diri anak. Kajian ini menggunakan metode studi kepustakaan dengan mengumpulkan data dari jurnal ilmiah dan sumber relevan lainnya. Hasil kajian menunjukkan bahwa ketidakhadiran ayah berdampak negatif terhadap pembentukan kepercayaan diri </span>anak<span style=\"color: black;\">, yang ditandai dengan rendahnya harga diri, kurangnya motivasi, serta kesulitan dalam mengenali potensi diri.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: ketiadaan ayah, peran ayah, kepercayaan diri anak, perkembangan anak</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1v6y1zLJdhsNQj97ABtC-FOXMnXRIFufX/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Adhi, Salamah Jati, ‘Hubungan Keterlibatan Ayah Dalam Pengasuhan Dengan Kepercayaan Diri Anak Usia 5-6 Tahun’, 4 (2025)</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Gusman, Della Tia, and Yeniar Indriana, ‘HUBUNGAN ANTARA PERSEPSI TERHADAP PERAN AYAH DENGAN HARGA DIRI PADA SISWA SMK NEGERI 3 SEMARANG’, 7 (2018), 396–403</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Irawan, Puti, ‘Gambaran Keterlibatan Ayah Dalam Pembentukkan Harga Diri Pada Dewasa Muda’, 9 (2025), 24663–71</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Jin, Zhiling, ‘The Influence of Paternal Absence During Childhood on Women’s Self-Esteem and Self-Efficacy: A Perspective Paper’, <em>Journal of Psychology and Behavior Studies</em>, 4 (2024), 57–61 &lt;https://doi.org/10.32996/jpbs.2024.1.7&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Larasati, Savira Aida, and Diana Rahmasari, ‘Hubungan Peran Ayah Dengan Kepercayaan Diri Pada Anak Perempuan The Relationship Between The Role of Father and Confidence in Daughter Abstrak’, 11 (2024), 922–33</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Marssel M. Sengkey, Nova Lisye Sinaulan, Queen Maharani Kartika Kalalo, Varel Eldad Onemarch Mamuaja, Wenly Napoleon Ontolay, and Yesi Padoma, ‘Figur Yang Hilang, Keyakinan Yang Terganggu: Tinjauan Literatur Tentang Kepercayaan Diri Anak Fatherless’, <em>Jurnal Pengabdian Masyarakat Dan Riset Pendidikan</em>, 3 (2025), 5835–40 &lt;https://doi.org/10.31004/jerkin.v3i4.1505&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Mestika, Zed, ‘Metode Penelitian Kepustakaan’, <em>Jakarta, Yayasan Obor Indonesia</em>, 2011, 42–52</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Rahmawati, Ashri Maulida, Edita Pusparatri, Fania Nurul Khairunnisa, and Muhamad Jauhar, ‘Father Presence, Emotion Regulation, and Adolescent Self-Confidence’, <em>Raflesia Nursing Journal</em>, 6 (2024), 101–12 &lt;https://doi.org/10.1234/jkr.v6i2.893&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Rossall, Carlo Amadeo, and Rudangta Arianti, ‘The Silent Struggle: Early Paternal Loss and Its Influence on Adolescent Self-Esteem’, <em>Journal of Psychological Perspective</em>, 7 (2025), 87–98 &lt;https://doi.org/10.47679/jopp.7210552025&gt;</p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">Samsudin, ‘Pentingnya Peran Orangtua Dalam Membentuk Kepribadian Anak Samsudin Institut Agama Islam Sunan Giri ( INSURI ) Ponorogo Email ; Samsu_ist@yahoo.Co.Id’, <em>Jurnal Pendidikan Islam Dan Multikulturalisme</em>, 1 (2019), 50–61</p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:13:58', '2026-04-16 03:13:58', NULL, 0, NULL),
(21, 'Peran Kebiasaan Membaca Dalam Meningkatkan Nilai Akademik Siswa', 'peran-kebiasaan-membaca-dalam-meningkatkan-nilai-akademik-siswa', 'published', 'Ratri Puspita Sari', 'Jurnal', 'Ke-16 (2026)', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\">	<strong>Peran Kebiasaan Membaca Dalam Meningkatkan Nilai Akademik Siswa</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Ratri Puspita Sari, Hadi Khaerudin, Intan Meidyawati</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><a href=\"mailto:puspitasari071711@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: blue;\">puspitasari071711@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><em style=\"color: black;\">This study aims to examine the relationship between reading habits and students’ academic achievement through a library research approach. The findings indicate a positive correlation between reading habits and academic performance. Students with strong reading habits tend to have better comprehension, critical thinking skills, and higher academic scores. Factors such as family environment, school support, and availability of reading materials influence the development of reading habits. Therefore, it is essential for schools and families to consistently promote a reading culture to enhance the quality of education and improve students’ academic achievement.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords: </strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Reading habits, academic achievement, literacy culture, learning performance, students, library research</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><em style=\"color: black;\">Penelitian ini bertujuan untuk mengetahui hubungan antara kebiasaan membaca dengan nilai akademik siswa melalui pendekatan studi pustaka. Hasil kajian menunjukkan bahwa terdapat hubungan positif antara kebiasaan membaca dan prestasi akademik. Siswa yang memiliki minat dan kebiasaan membaca yang tinggi cenderung memiliki pemahaman yang lebih baik terhadap materi pelajaran dan memperoleh nilai yang lebih tinggi. Faktor-faktor seperti lingkungan keluarga, sekolah, serta ketersediaan bahan bacaan turut memengaruhi pembentukan kebiasaan membaca. Oleh karena itu, penting bagi sekolah dan keluarga untuk menumbuhkan budaya membaca secara berkelanjutan guna meningkatkan kualitas pendidikan dan prestasi akademik siswa.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: </strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Kebiasaan membaca, nilai akademik, budaya literasi, prestasi belajar, siswa, studi pustaka</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TY590VUAehAdEiLZzKaonmuAC1JkF1qj/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Betti rouli manik1, y. D. (2022). Faktor-faktor yang mempengaruhi prestasi belajar siswa pada mata pelajaran ips kelas viii di smp negeri 1 pegagan hilir. 3616 - 3625.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Bu’ulolo, y. (2021). Membangun budaya literasi di sekolah. 16 - 22.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Dermawan, h. M. (2023). Gerakan literasi sekolah sebagai solusi peningkatan minat baca pada anak sekolah dasar. 311-328.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Dharmawati, d. (2020). Penyediaan rumah baca masyarakat sebagai solusi cerdas mengawali budaya membaca. 36-42.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Eka nurul mualimah, u. (2018). Pengaruh kebiasaan membaca terhadap prestasi belajar bahasa indonesia siswa kelas v sdn kubanglaban. </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Jpsd vol. 4 no. 1, maret 2018</em><span style=\"color: black;\">, 43 - 54.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Elendiana, m. (2020). Upaya meningkatkan minta baca siswa sekolah dasar. 54 -n60.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Herawati, n. I. (2022). </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Solusi kesulitan membaca.</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> </span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Iklima lutfiah hanum, s. A. (2025). Membaca sejak dini: kebiasaan membaca di kalangan siswa sekolah dasar. 2439 - 2445.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Lestari, n. D. (2021). Analisis faktor-faktor yang menghambat belajar membaca permulaan pada siswa sekolah dasar. 2611 - 2616.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Mulyaningsih, i. E. (2014). Pengaruh interaksi sosial keluarga, motivasi belajar, dan kemandirian belajar terhadap prestasi belajar. 441 - 450.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Ni’matullah, o. F. (2019). Pengaruh minat dan kebiasaan membaca siswa terhadap hasil belajar geografi sma. 197–205.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Putri, a. A. (2024). Analisis kesulitan belajar membaca pada siswa kelas ii: faktor penyebab dan solusi. 2962-7494.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">R. W., p. A. (2025). Pemanfaatan pojokbaca dalam meningkatkan minat baca peserta didik kelasiii di sekolah dasar. 1549-1560.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:16:44', '2026-04-16 03:16:44', NULL, 0, NULL),
(22, 'Faktor Mengonsumsi Kopi Terhadap Konsenstrasi Belajar Siswa', 'faktor-mengonsumsi-kopi-terhadap-konsenstrasi-belajar-siswa', 'published', 'Anindhita Quena', 'Jurnal', '', '2025/2026', 'XII B - IPA', '<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong>Faktor Mengonsumsi Kopi Terhadap Konsenstrasi Belajar Siswa</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">Anindhita Quena, Hadi Khaerudin, Fathul Mughni</p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Siswa kelas XII SMAIT AL-FIDAA</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Jl. Damai. 8, Jl. Kp. Bulu No.Rt 05/23, Setiamekar, Kec. Tambun Sel., Jawa Barat 17510</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: black;\">quena.kriting@gmail.com</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstract</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<em style=\"color: black;\">Coffee is a beverage made from processed Coffea beans containing bioactive compounds, primarily caffeine, which acts as a natural stimulant for the central nervous system. This study aims to determine the effect of coffee consumption on students’ learning concentration. Caffeine works by blocking adenosine receptors in the brain, thereby increasing alertness, focus, and cognitive performance. In moderate doses (50–200 mg per day), coffee helps students maintain concentration, especially during late-night study sessions. However, excessive consumption may cause sleep disturbances, anxiety, and reduced focus. Factors such as social habits, lifestyle, and the need to stay awake also influence students’ coffee-drinking behavior. Therefore, moderate and controlled coffee consumption can positively impact learning concentration, while excessive intake may lead to negative effects on health and academic performance.</em></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Keywords: coffee, caffeine, learning concentration, students</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"color: black;\">Abstrak</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\">	<span style=\"color: black;\">Kopi merupakan minuman hasil olahan biji Coffea yang mengandung senyawa bioaktif utama berupa kafein, yang berfungsi sebagai stimulan sistem saraf pusat. Penelitian ini bertujuan untuk mengetahui pengaruh konsumsi kopi terhadap konsentrasi belajar siswa. Kafein bekerja dengan menghambat reseptor adenosin di otak, sehingga meningkatkan kewaspadaan, fokus, dan daya tangkap. Dalam dosis moderat (50–200 mg per hari), kopi dapat membantu siswa menjaga konsentrasi, terutama saat belajar di malam hari. Namun, konsumsi berlebihan dapat menyebabkan gangguan tidur, kecemasan, dan penurunan fokus. Faktor-faktor seperti kebiasaan sosial, gaya hidup, dan kebutuhan untuk tetap terjaga juga</span><strong style=\"color: black;\"> </strong><span style=\"color: black;\">memengaruhi kebiasaan minum kopi di kalangan siswa. Dengan demikian, konsumsi kopi yang bijak dan terkontrol dapat memberikan manfaat terhadap konsentrasi belajar, sedangkan konsumsi berlebihan justru menimbulkan efek negatif bagi kesehatan dan performa akademik.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Kata Kunci: kopi, kafein, konsentrasi belajar, siswa, stimulasi saraf pusat</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Download: </strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LGsyqyJobO854t7vJoAr5KOtxF9p750R/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>PDF</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Referensi</strong></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Ibnu Sina dkk., </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Pengaruh Konsumsi Kopi Terhadap Konsentrasi Belajar Pada Mahasiswa Fakultas Teknik The Effect Of Coffee Consumption On Learning Concentration On The Students Of The Faculty Of Engineering</em><span style=\"color: black;\">, 23, no. 2 (2024).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Lina P Agustiana dkk., “Hubungan Konsumsi Kopi dengan Kualitas Tidur pada Remaja,” dalam </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Colostrum Mother Journal Original Article</em><span style=\"color: black;\">, vol. 1 (2024).</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Juliano, L. M., &amp; Griffiths, R. R. (2004). </span><em style=\"color: black;\">A critical review of caffeine withdrawal: empirical validation of symptoms and signs.</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Psychopharmacology</em><span style=\"color: black;\">, 176(1), 1–29.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Nehlig, A. (2010). </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Is caffeine a cognitive enhancer?</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> Journal of Alzheimer’s Disease, 20(Suppl 1), S85–S94.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Sari, D., &amp; Fadillah, A. (2021). </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Perilaku Konsumsi Kopi di Kalangan Mahasiswa: Antara Gaya Hidup dan Kebutuhan.</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> Jurnal Psikologi dan Perilaku Sosial, 8(2), 55–63</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Nehlig, A. (2010). </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Is caffeine a cognitive enhancer?</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> Journal of Alzheimer’s Disease, 20(Suppl 1), S85–S94</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">“Effects of caffeine and caffeine withdrawal on mood and cognitive performance degraded by sleep restriction”</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Rogers P.J., Heatherley S.V., Hayward R.C., Seers H.E., Hill J., Kane M. </span><em style=\"color: black;\">Psychopharmacology</em><span style=\"color: black;\"> (2005) 179(4):742-752. DOI:10.1007/s00213-004-2097-y.</span></p><p><br></p>', '', '2026-04-16 03:20:54', '2026-04-16 03:20:54', NULL, 0, NULL);

